      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "objective-card",
      "description": "Pergunta e dois cartões, com número lateral, como a primeira dobra da referência.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-objective\"><h1>Qual o nosso <mark>objetivo?</mark></h1><div class=\"ds-objectives\"><article><span>1.</span><h3>Gerar valor a ponto de me recomendar no final</h3></article><article><span>2.</span><h3>Fecharmos negócio</h3></article></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-objective{padding:32px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);text-align:center}.ds-objective h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(36px,7vw,64px);font-weight:400;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-objective mark{background:var(--accent);color:var(--ink);padding:0 .12em .05em;border-radius:.08em}.ds-objectives{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:48px;text-align:left}.ds-objectives article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;min-height:180px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line-dark);border-radius:24px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 70px var(--shadow)}.ds-objectives article>span{display:grid;align-self:stretch;place-items:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line-dark);font-size:34px;color:var(--accent)}.ds-objectives h3{margin:0;padding:24px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-objectives{grid-template-columns:1fr}}"
