      "html": "<label class=\"ds-question\"><span>1.</span><div><strong>Você já investe em anúncios ou pretende começar?</strong><select aria-label=\"Investimento em anúncios\"><option>Anotar resposta</option><option>Já invisto</option><option>Vou começar</option><option>Já investi e parei</option></select></div></label>",
      "css": ".ds-question{display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:28px 24px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:var(--font);border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark)}.ds-question>span{font-size:42px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;color:var(--accent)}.ds-question strong{font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:400;display:block;max-width:420px}.ds-question select{width:100%;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);background:transparent;color:var(--text-dark-muted);font-family:var(--font);font-size:11px;padding:12px 24px 12px 0;line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px;color-scheme:dark}.ds-question select:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.ds-question select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
